  "Metadata": {
    "$id": "176",
    "Name": "test1 - First landing river valley",
    "Description": "512 m square valley study, 128 m height scale. Canyon / strata / erosion / rivers / masked gate clearing. Select 08 - COLOURED PREVIEW for the colour view; 05 - Terrain with gate clearing for geometry. Community build: 1024. Gate clearing position and elevation are provisional: inspect in Gaea before export. Water surface/depth require water_mask; they are not terrain collision. Terrain is not yet imported into StargateGame. Node patterns based on bundled QuadSpinner examples Canyon River with Sea, Rocky Riverbed and Cartography - 3D Mountain Map.",
    "Version": "2.3.1.0",
    "Edition": "Community",
    "Owner": "",
